    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that the \"support\" feels like more work. another person to explain myself to, another thing i have to manage. it all feels so pointless. like, why bother trying to fix a broken engine when the whole car is just destined to crash anyway? it's just so much effort to keep up the mask.",
